  digest=b3:11bace52c3f6a1feea7c296e9e01683e56a51551445b6e43202464508be9bf50 file=MCL/llm/llm.go range=620:632 lang=go exported=false byte_range=22017:22562
  sig=func (c *Client) dispatchHeaders(h http.Header)
  doc=dispatchHeaders invokes the configured OnResponseHeaders hook with\nthe upstream response headers. Panics in the callback are swallowed\nso a buggy hook never propagates into Decode/Stream's contract.\nDaemons read X-Matrix-Cost-Pax + Daily-Spent + Daily-Remaining off\nthe headers passed in; gateway proxy stamps these on every metered\ncall (plan §5.15).
