NODE id=matrix/mcl/llm.Config#OnResponseHeaders kind=field
  digest=b3:afeb9dd8355cbaa2558513889652cec7e9d9a2b57588aea4d79e594f0416d934 file=MCL/llm/llm.go range=224:231 lang=go exported=true byte_range=7973:8407
  sig=func(http.Header)
  doc=OnResponseHeaders, when non-nil, is invoked exactly once per\nsuccessful AND failed Decode/Stream HTTP round-trip with the\nraw http.Response.Header. Daemons hook this to capture the\ngateway's X-Matrix-Cost-Pax / Daily-Spent / Daily-Remaining\ntrailers without having to wrap the LLM call sites. Panics in\nthe callback are swallowed to keep Decode/Stream's contract\nintact.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/mcl/llm.Config

