NODE id=matrix/mcl/llm.ForgeRegistry kind=func
  digest=b3:d3933f0411529d426e275a0f8916d87bf034017a96f3c55061ea50007ca5b8c5 file=MCL/llm/model.go range=518:613 lang=go exported=true byte_range=17456:21547
  sig=func ForgeRegistry() *ModelRegistry
  doc=ForgeRegistry returns the v1 Forge model router populated per matrix.kvx\nsess#34. Powers the local self-maintenance Matrix instance whose sole\npurpose is to optimize its own codebase at /root/matrix.\n\nRouting strategy:\n\n	SlotCompiler              gpt-5.5             (fast structured-output for verb classify + frame extract)\n	SlotPlanner               claude-opus-4-7     (strongest reasoning for plan_tree@1 synthesis)\n	SlotExecutor/reason       claude-opus-4-7     (agentic loops, code-context reasoning)\n	SlotExecutor/code         claude-opus-4-7     (code-gen at frontier quality)\n	SlotExecutor/summarize    gpt-5.5             (long-context summarisation)\n	SlotExecutor/write        claude-opus-4-7     (prose / docs)\n	SlotExecutor/transform    gpt-5.5             (structured shape, no creativity)\n	SlotExecutor/classify     gpt-5.5             (pick-from-list, fast)\n	SlotExecutor/hard_reason  claude-opus-4-7     (formal proofs, adversarial debugging)\n\nEvery route has InjectIdentity=true so the Matrix-maintaining-Matrix\nidentity preamble (llm.IdentityPreamble) ships on every routed call.\nProviderSet=true so DetectProvider is skipped (bare opencode model ids\nlike "claude-opus-4-7" and "gpt-5.5" don't fit the "<vendor>/<model>"\nshape).\n\nCaller pins OPENCODE_API_KEY in the daemon environment; New() reads it\nvia envKey(ProviderOpencode).
EDGES
  calls=matrix/mcl/llm.ModelRegistry.Register,matrix/mcl/llm.NewModelRegistry
  references=matrix/mcl/llm.Config,matrix/mcl/llm.ForgeModelClaudeOpus47,matrix/mcl/llm.ForgeModelGPT55,matrix/mcl/llm.GrammarNone,matrix/mcl/llm.KindClassify,matrix/mcl/llm.KindCode,matrix/mcl/llm.KindHardReason,matrix/mcl/llm.KindReason,matrix/mcl/llm.KindSummarize,matrix/mcl/llm.KindTransform,matrix/mcl/llm.KindWrite,matrix/mcl/llm.ModelRegistry,matrix/mcl/llm.ModelRegistry.Register,matrix/mcl/llm.NewModelRegistry,matrix/mcl/llm.OpencodeMessagesEndpoint,matrix/mcl/llm.OpencodeResponsesEndpoint,matrix/mcl/llm.ProviderOpencode,matrix/mcl/llm.RouteKey,matrix/mcl/llm.ShapeMessages,matrix/mcl/llm.ShapeResponses,matrix/mcl/llm.SlotCompiler,matrix/mcl/llm.SlotExecutor,matrix/mcl/llm.SlotLiaison,matrix/mcl/llm.SlotPlanner,matrix/mcl/llm.compiler,matrix/mcl/llm.executorClassify,matrix/mcl/llm.executorCode,matrix/mcl/llm.executorHardReason,matrix/mcl/llm.executorReason,matrix/mcl/llm.executorSummarize,matrix/mcl/llm.executorTransform,matrix/mcl/llm.executorWrite,matrix/mcl/llm.gpt55,matrix/mcl/llm.liaison,matrix/mcl/llm.maxTok,matrix/mcl/llm.opus,matrix/mcl/llm.planner,matrix/mcl/llm.reg,matrix/mcl/llm.temp
  ^calls=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.daemonState.callLiaison,matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.newLLMStepHandlerOpts,matrix/mcl/llm.ForgeCompilerModel,matrix/mcl/llm.ForgeExecutorModel,matrix/mcl/llm.ForgePlannerModel
  ^references=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.daemonState.callLiaison,matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.newLLMStepHandlerOpts,matrix/mcl/llm.ForgeCompilerModel,matrix/mcl/llm.ForgeExecutorModel,matrix/mcl/llm.ForgePlannerModel
  ^defines=matrix/mcl/llm/model.go

