NODE id=matrix/mcl/llm.messagesClient.buildRequest kind=method
  digest=b3:3e35008731b8af4d8b25c80c44649cdf1c6382dec6a4bfafbf5eea593e46ddf2 file=MCL/llm/messages_api.go range=203:239 lang=go exported=false byte_range=6940:8053
  sig=func (c *messagesClient) buildRequest(messages []interpreter.Message) *messagesRequest
  doc=buildRequest assembles the messagesRequest. Splits role=system messages\nout into the top-level `system` field (Anthropic requirement) and folds\nthe rest into the `messages[]` array. Multiple system messages are\nconcatenated with double-newline separators in declaration order — the\nnatural reading order matches the OpenAI convention where every system\nmessage is appended.
EDGES
  references=matrix/mcl/llm.c,matrix/mcl/llm.convo,matrix/mcl/llm.m,matrix/mcl/llm.maxTokens,matrix/mcl/llm.messages,matrix/mcl/llm.messagesClient,matrix/mcl/llm.messagesRequest,matrix/mcl/llm.messagesTurn,matrix/mcl/llm.req,matrix/mcl/llm.role,matrix/mcl/llm.systemParts,matrix/mcl/mtx/interpreter.Message
