  sig=func (c *messagesClient) dispatchHeaders(h http.Header)
  doc=dispatchHeaders invokes the configured OnResponseHeaders hook with the\nupstream response headers. Mirrors (*Client).dispatchHeaders verbatim so\ngateway header capture (sess#33 cost telemetry) works uniformly across\nevery API shape.
